This product is a modified version of claude-telegram-supercharged
(https://github.com/k1p1l0/claude-telegram-supercharged), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, which in turn derives from Anthropic's Telegram
channel plugin for Claude Code, also licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0.

Modifications include per-bot state directories for running many bots from one
install, a local message-history store, deterministic slash-command handling,
inline-button layout changes, configurable host-script paths, and reliability
fixes. Files carry a notice where they were changed. The full licence text is
in telegram/LICENSE.
